"
====================
Brake Pressure Modes
====================
Checks the brake pressure limit holds in each braking mode.

Requirements
------------
1. :req:`VMCBRA00002`
2. :req:`VMCBRA00003`
"

(variations "mode pressure"
  ["nominal"   [:normal 60]
   "degraded"  [:limp-home 75]
   "emergency" [:emergency max-pressure]])

"
Steps
-----
"

(Wait 1)
(brake-pressure-ok? pressure)
